### Mini-Prontuario - testes da API
@host = http://localhost:3000

### Health -> 200
GET {{host}}/api/health

### Listar pacientes -> 200
GET {{host}}/api/patients

### Paciente existente -> 200
GET {{host}}/api/patients/1

### Paciente inexistente -> 404
GET {{host}}/api/patients/9999

### Listar atendimentos -> 200
GET {{host}}/api/patients/1/encounters

### Criar atendimento -> 201
POST {{host}}/api/patients/1/encounters
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startedAt": "2026-08-17T09:30",
  "chiefComplaint": "Cefaleia ha tres dias",
  "notes": "Orientada hidratacao e retorno em 7 dias."
}

### Erro: sem chiefComplaint -> 400
POST {{host}}/api/patients/1/encounters
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startedAt": "2026-08-17T09:30"
}

### Erro: chiefComplaint só com espaços -> 400
POST {{host}}/api/patients/1/encounters
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startedAt": "2026-08-17T09:30",
  "chiefComplaint": "   "
}

### Erro: startedAt fora do formato -> 400
POST {{host}}/api/patients/1/encounters
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startedAt": "17/08/2026 09:30",
  "chiefComplaint": "Teste"
}

### Erro: POST em paciente inexistente -> 404
POST {{host}}/api/patients/9999/encounters
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startedAt": "2026-08-17T09:30",
  "chiefComplaint": "Teste"
}

### Erro: GET em paciente inexistente -> 404
GET {{host}}/api/patients/9999/encounters
